{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17844","headline":"游义兴寺寄上李逢吉相公 · 令狐楚","name":"游义兴寺寄上李逢吉相公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"柳营无事诣莲宫，步步犹疑是梦中。\n劳役徒爲万夫长，闲游曾与二人同。\n凤鸾飞去仙巢在，龙象潜来讲席空。\n松下花飞频伫立，一心千里忆梁公。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"令狐楚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17844.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17844","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}